 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+The public `coupled-status` command, implemented by `src/coupled_status.rs`,
+owns the read-only projection of native coupled-run records. It does not add or modify persistent state: `iterations.json` and each
+native `state/tui-work.json` ledger remain the source of truth. The projection
+counts wire requests from ledger records and task requests from their native
+charge values, treating an omitted charge as the task default. An interrupted
+ledger that is absent is represented as unknown rather than zero; budget limits
+remain owned by the manifest.
